&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-ARMWdtKDIowwlyxaSOuuzEqssIf&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;Kpucdjv7JoAcSZxSf7PuRl5Yscb&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;At OKX, we believe that the future will be reshaped by crypto, and ultimately contribute to every individual&#39;s freedom.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;OKX is a leading crypto exchange, and the developer of OKX Wallet, giving millions access to crypto trading and decentralized crypto applications (dApps). OKX is also a trusted brand by hundreds of large institutions seeking access to crypto markets. We are safe and reliable, backed by our Proof of Reserves.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;Across our multiple offices globally, we are united by our core principles:&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;We Before Me&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;Do the Right Thing&lt;/em&gt;, and &lt;em&gt;Get Things Done&lt;/em&gt;. These shared values drive our culture, shape our processes, and foster a friendly, rewarding, and diverse environment for every OK-er. OKX is part of OKG, a group that brings the value of Blockchain to users around the world, through our leading products OKX, OKX Wallet, OKLink and more.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;PNNZdiw4Yo1ZOmx8btbucw8qsLG&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-PiRwdXFmiomeQDxx0RUuDGJ1sag&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NrSYd8kjeoNTrexRDNsuNpZOsMd&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;JupAdNVweoIOzSx2CMwlOVZ2gqo&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlg8C2LuXlLcXV9KZYpnEOccm&quot;&gt;OKX continues to invest heavily in localisation across European markets. There are two real bottlenecks: translation quality and scale are hard to achieve at the same time, and the problem is rarely &quot;is the translation accurate&quot; — it is &quot;can users understand it, and can they get through the flow&quot;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlg1iwyNYcPwryscgIFf3U1rg&quot;&gt;You will own two things: &lt;strong&gt;rebuilding the translation and quality-evaluation pipeline around large language models&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;building an AI-assisted localisation monitoring and remediation system&lt;/strong&gt;. You will be accountable for the business outcomes of localisation.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlg1iwyNYcPwryscgIFf3U1rg&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlg1iwyNYcPwryscgIFf3U1rg&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;JupAdNVweoIOzSx2CMwlOVZ2gqo&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgZZpQWfpqp6NDnboCSg6fWg&quot;&gt;This role does &lt;strong&gt;not&lt;/strong&gt; require a linguistics or translation background, multilingual ability, or algorithm engineering skills. We are looking for someone who can make the whole organisation share responsibility for localisation quality.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-HytwdMMd1o5PQtxqi9QudDSMsWV&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;JupAdNVweoIOzSx2CMwlOVZ2gqo&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlg6ysgYoWVygGmfCSlcfZBMg&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI translation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlg2tzooHc203wZpz3w69WJqh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Have LLMs carry translation and quality evaluation at scale, so human effort concentrates on setting the standards and making the final calls&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgHAc6Ia2N09G7O2CbgJbqxb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Keep translation quality stable while coverage expands substantially, so cost no longer grows linearly with languages, content and releases&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgefVQ0ZNXoLUz2nO2vfY8Tc&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Monitoring and remediation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgcpEoMS3mvqM03Vzbqursid&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Ensure localisation issues are caught before release, monitored after release, and genuinely verified once fixed&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgKtrn0kkrODhJw8lsgml1Qh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Ensure conversion on key user journeys is not damaged by language issues&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgx9GFxJPuGwbGF26UqwBQle&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Drive a sustained reduction in severe production issues and in issues that recur&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlg0ypkdn6b6n5GCPkmrQUhfd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shared objectives&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlga5bAaQModYIbi8qekSmkPg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Make localisation quality a responsibility shared by product, design, engineering, content and compliance — not something the language team carries alone&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlg1jV2620JY4QtX0sawqPU0e&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Turn every issue found into a preventive capability in the system&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
