&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong cross-functional influence&lt;/strong&gt; — a track record of getting other teams to accept constraints or change their process without direct reporting authority. &lt;strong&gt;This is the single most important capability for this role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgS6DxIGzah7ifd2Lawfq8zc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
