&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgcOXafGQqW3r8aWx5y8jvqh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sound judgement on AI / &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;LLM&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; products&lt;/strong&gt; — no algorithms background required, but you can tell what should be handed to a model and what must stay with a human&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgQZjIaotNqnApUpYbBvQR0d&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
