&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxushHxPgvpIV0pJrijghkWDWe&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Lead the planning and design of structured products, including principal-protected products, yield enhancement strategies, and custom payoff structures tailored to diverse user segments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem&quot; data-eleid=&quot;22&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem__text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;23&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;Develop short and medium-term product iteration plans and roadmaps, taking into account market situation, product life cycle, competitive landscape, and available resources.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem&quot; data-eleid=&quot;26&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem__text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;27&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;Oversee project progress and cooperate with developers, designers, quantitative analysts, risk management, marketing, operations, and other departments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem&quot; data-eleid=&quot;30&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem__text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;31&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;Use data-driven thinking to explore the core logic that affects &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only text-with-abbreviation text-with-abbreviation-bottomline&quot;&gt;AUM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt; growth and user growth; formulate and implement growth and operation strategies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
